Package: bsikompendium
Type: Package
Title: Offline Checks Supporting BSI 'IT-Grundschutz' Assessments
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: c(person("Dimitrios", "Geromichalos", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "riskdatascience@web.de"), person("RiskDataScience GmbH", role = "cph"))
Description: Supports structured information security assessments based on
    the 'IT-Grundschutz' Compendium of the German Federal Office for
    Information Security (BSI) (2023, ISBN:978-3-8462-0906-6), including
    errata dated 2026-03-26, and BSI Standards 200-1, 200-2 and 200-3 (2017).
    Provides an indexed requirement catalogue, individually derived assessment
    contracts, protection needs, risk assessment and selected technical checks.
    Runs locally and requires qualified user assessments; it does not certify
    compliance. The Compendium is catalogued at
    <https://epflicht.ulb.uni-bonn.de/content/titleinfo/750346>.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: de
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: jsonlite, stats
NeedsCompilation: no
